  clock: 4  # c2d9
  nonce: c2d9  # c2d9
  message: "TAGGED awaits_bakeoff_validation because this PR carries quantitative improvement claims (+756 edge reach; 224 new situations), which is what the rule keys on. But A DEFAULT BAKEOFF CANNOT DISCHARGE IT, and saying so now prevents the queue from filing a phantom regression when it reads no_move: measurement 0022's D1 shows the default arm is byte-for-byte unmoved (pretix 149 -> 149), BY CONSTRUCTION, because WI-bifob excludes test-sourced flows and every site in this population is under src/tests/.\n\nTHE ARM THAT DISCHARGES IT: a survey-level check that distinct (src,dst) django.db.models pairs on pretix are ~6,861 rather than ~6,105 (+756), and/or a verify-claims run WITH --include-non-production-sources showing ~837 situations rather than ~613. Neither is what bakeoff-broad or bakeoff-deep runs by default.\n\nThis is the SAME structural gap WI-divoz is parked on (needs_human_review): the tag has no bucket for a fix the default validation arm cannot observe. WI-divoz's case was inert-until-a-sibling-lands; this one is invisible-to-the-default-arm-by-construction. Two distinct shapes, one missing bucket -- worth noting on WI-divoz when it is decided."  # c2d9
